 #: ../xfce4-settings-manager/xfce-settings-manager.desktop.in.h:2
 msgid "Graphical Settings Manager for Xfce 4"
 msgstr "የ ንድፍ ማሰናጃዎች አስተዳዳሪ ለ Xfce 4"
